WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.660
Here you are. Good work, Yume-chan.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.620
Thanks, Koharu-chan.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:23.920
That was a great performance! 
Do you mind if I intrude as well?

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.370
Aria-chan!

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.170
Come on in. So you came to watch?

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:32.100
Yes! That was a very wonderful show!

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.590
Also...

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.330
We have a gig together later, don't we?{I feel like we used this word a lot more in non-StarsI know, I know}

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.490
Right!

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.860
But I've got something else scheduled before it.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:42.940
May I come along with you?

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.230
Sure, that's fine.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:49.480
I want to see more and more of your Aikatsu.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.930
Thanks.

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:53.240
But I've gotta work even harder at it.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:57.550
I want lots of people to see the dresses I made with Koharu-chan, after all.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:03.750
I'll keep improving my shows, and work my way higher and higher up the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:09.500
Otherwise I won't be able to achieve my new goal of getting that Sun Dress Elza-san was talking about.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.720
You're so into it, Yume-chan.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.660
I need to get going soon.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:17.050
You're going already?

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.510
Yeah, I've got a magazine interview.

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.740
After that, I'll guest-star in Hime-senpai's show with Aria-chan.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:25.520
Right!

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:30.560
And then I need to finalize the program for our next S4 TV...

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:36.030
Yume-chan, you're making wrinkles on your forehead.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.010
Huh?! Really?

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.700
I've gotta be more careful.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.200
Don't overexert yourself.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.370
I won't, don't worry.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.370
S4's gotta set a high standard for Four Star Academy.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:49.500
Yume-chan, you're amazing!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.170
Now then, it's off to our next location.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.510
Let's go!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:39.360
Let's move on to the next question.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.740
What's the best thing about being in S4?

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:48.830
Well, it's having more opportunities to be on stage, 
which has allowed me to sing in front of many more people.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:53.500
Then what's been the most fun Aikatsu you've done recently?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.360
Huh?

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.250
Um...

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.500
Nijino-san?

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:07.500
Let's see, I'm performing a lot more than I did before, 
plus I get to do a wider variety of work, so I feel fulfilled.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.470
It's all very fun!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.660
<i>Huh? Can I really say I had fun doing any of that?</i>

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:20.150
Nijino-san, can I ask for a smile?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.250
Huh? Was I looking tense just now?

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:30.040
Stop that. You shouldn't get in the photographer's way.

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:32.630
Was that not allowed?

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.200
I'm sorry.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:41.670
That was a nice expression! Thank you!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.380
Yume-chan's Aikatsu is so nice! It's very nice!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.040
Okay, on to the next one.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.310
Roger!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:58.070
S4 members sure have it tough.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.360
Does it ever tire you out?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.490
I used to play volleyball, so I'm not worried about wearing out.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.500
I'm totally fine doing this.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.870
That's awesome.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.470
I know! Why don't I teach you how to play sometime?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:16.540
They might start calling you the Fairy of the Court, and you'd fly around landing some nice attacks. {considered offense somewhere}

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.610
Here it comes, Aria-chan!

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:20.590
Attack!

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.090
That's the game!

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:26.090
Victory goes to the Four Star Fairies!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.390
Yume...chan?

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.570
My imagination went a little wild there.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.860
You're funny, Yume-chan.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:44.950
<i>Come to think of it, I haven't really daydreamed much recently.</i>

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:51.450
<i>Hime-senpai's show is a live broadcast.</i>

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:54.500
<i>I'm getting nervous.</i>

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:58.500
<i>It'll be okay. I triple-checked the program already.</i>

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.920
Going live!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.580
Three! Two!

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:09.260
Sending Shiratori Hime's Heart to You!

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.780
The Hime Curry Plan!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:14.330
Everyone, Namaste!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:20.830
Today I've invited Nijino Yume-chan and Futaba Aria-chan to join me as guests.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.900
Thank you for having us.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:28.570
Hime-senpai, aren't you fresh off a trip around the world to see the Aikatsu it has to offer?

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:32.330
That's right! It was a very educational experience.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:38.290
I even got to taste authentic curry from India along the way.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.950
We'll be using the spice set I brought back to cook our own.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.010
Let's get started!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:50.240
First, heat your oil and add fragrant spices to it. {I tried looking up what she meant and have no idea. she's obviously adding a spice, but doesn't say what it isit's usually a mix of spices}

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:55.770
I've love to hear a story about your time in India.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:01.770
The dances were really interesting and filled me up with energy and power.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.750
It looked like this.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:06.030
That looks like fun!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.310
It looks very fun!

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:14.940
This is difficult. Am I doing it right?

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:18.040
Try to keep your head facing forward.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.150
<i>What? Now they've gotten really into their dance talk.</i>

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.790
<i>I have to keep the show going. What now?</i>

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.510
L-Let's take a look over here.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:32.930
It's full of spices I've never even heard of.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.410
What is this one called?

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:39.330
It's hengu. How does it smell? {we can do hengu if you wantI do want}

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.800
Incredible, isn't it? {apparently smells like shit, literally}

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:46.440
But when you use it for cooking, it takes on a sweet fragrance.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:50.440
It also has other names such as "devil's dung".

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.440
<i>I got us back on track.</i>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.820
The next step is sautéing the onions—

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.830
<i>What?! The ingredients aren't cut up!</i>

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.330
Hey! Why aren't they ready?!

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.490
<i>Now what? Can we still finish in time?</i>

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:07.460
Oh? I guess cooking programs don't cut the vegetables up in advance!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.340
A-Aria-chan...

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.690
Yume-chan.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:15.020
There's no need to work yourself up.

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:19.540
Now then, let's slice the onions!

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.600
Okay! I'll give it a try too!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.730
Then I'll grate the garlic.

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.440
Aria-chan, aren't those chunks kind of big?

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:36.200
Perhaps... but I'd feel bad if I cut them too much.

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:39.450
I guess it's fine.

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:42.040
First, put in the onions.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.710
Then the garlic and coriander.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.380
Follow it with turmeric and chili.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:51.460
Then finish it with yogurt and whole tomatoes.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.390
I can hear a melody brewing.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.890
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:07.430
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:06.200
My!

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:09.480
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:12.490
And it's ready!

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:17.550
What a delectable smell.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:19.970
<i>It's falling!</i>

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:22.370
Yume-chan, nice catch...?

00:09:25.070 --> 00:09:26.900
My, how charming!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:31.000
Yume-chan, it's lovely! Very lovely!

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:34.070
What a relief.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:35.020
Yume-chan.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.960
Thank you!

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:41.010
Today's curry is ready to eat!

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:43.380
Now then.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.700
Let's dig in! {tried to see if there was an indian equivalent}

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.690
Delicious!

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:56.070
When all of the spices combine, a wonderful scent is born!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:59.490
The different spices give it a complex flavor.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.490
It's a shock to your system in a good way.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.870
Try making it yourself if you get the chance. {sure, I'll just fly over to india right nowthe same technology that allows you to fly to india also allows the spices to fly from india}

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:09.690
That about wraps up today's program.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:12.830
Tune in next time to see another Hime Curry Plan!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.880
Look forward to it!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.380
Okay, we're clear!

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:22.140
Man, you covered for everyone so well back there.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.510
It was nothing.

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:27.520
Yume-chan.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:29.080
Well done.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.770
Same to you.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:34.750
I'm sorry I wasn't able to make smooth transitions.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.800
You think? I didn't notice.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:40.200
I think it turned out to be quite the fun show.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.660
Yeah...

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:46.820
Yume-chan, you don't need to push yourself that hard.

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:48.210
Don't forget to smile.{I cannot live without you forever}

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:54.800
That's it! Sometimes it's a good idea to change things up.{I think "change your perspective" is too thinky}

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.270
Like how?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.650
For instance, you can watch someone else's Aikatsu.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.340
Good work today!

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:10.060
Say, Yume-chan.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.610
What do you think about holding a show with Aria-chan?

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:17.340
I would be very happy!

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:21.240
Yume-chan, I'm looking forward to it!

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:23.940
Me too!

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.460
Yume! Welcome back!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.510
Girls.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:43.090
Oh, help yourselves to these.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:45.930
They're cinnamon rolls.{too pure. too good for this worldyeah}

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:47.890
Where's this coming from?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:52.230
I received them from the staff, but I'm not really in the mood.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.730
Yume, are you okay?!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.480
Did something bad happen?!

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:58.980
You can tell us anything!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.490
Y-You're overreacting.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.410
I do like them, but I don't feel like it right now.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.030
Unbelievable.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:10.200
She's always said she had a separate stomach for dessert.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.920
Sorry, I think I'm going to head back for tonight.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.590
She's definitely acting strange.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.550
It hasn't looked like she's gotten enough rest recently.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:26.100
She looked pretty exhausted after today's show too.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.680
It's because she's always running at full speed.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:32.690
That's usually her biggest strength, too.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:50.080
You always look like you're having so much fun when you Aikatsu, Aria-chan.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.710
That's because... I'm in love.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:57.880
What?! L-Love?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.340
What do you mean?

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.550
There's somewhere I'd like to go!

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.350
So this is where you wanted to go...

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.390
Aria-chan?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.900
Let's Aikatsu!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.650
Huh? With me?

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.400
I couldn't...

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:25.320
Excuse me! Would you like to Aikatsu with me?

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.410
Oh my! I'm afraid I need to go shopping though.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.160
<i>Aria-chan...</i>

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.660
What's the matter?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.410
Let's Aikatsu.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.420
Aikatsu?

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.500
Yes!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.960
Yume-chan, over here! Let's Aikatsu together!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:45.550
Coming!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.180
But I'm not an idol...

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.550
Don't worry.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.560
This is your stage.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:07.700
Nice! That's a nice smile!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.530
You look very cute!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:18.830
Aria-chan starts up Aikatsu wherever she pleases.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.510
Aikatsu is so much fun! I love it!

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:30.430
It sounds like you've fallen in love with Aikatsu.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:36.060
<i>I see... I've been missing what Aria-chan has lately.</i>

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:40.190
<i>I wasn't enjoying Aikatsu to the point of falling in love with it.</i>

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.400
Bye-bye!

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.280
Let's Aikatsu tomorrow too!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.110
Aria-chan.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.580
When you said you were in love, did you mean with Aikatsu?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.950
Yes, that's right.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:02.210
I can't help thinking of Aikatsu even when I'm eating or sleeping.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:06.340
It always makes me happy and feel like I'm having fun.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.090
It can't be anything but love!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:16.600
I understand. You must love having lessons and getting to see everyone's Aikatsu.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:21.940
Yes. I love it, so I want to show everyone my own Aikatsu.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:25.480
I want to sprout the Aikatsu flower all around the world.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.820
I think I understand what love is a bit better.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.950
I guess that makes us rivals.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:34.660
Huh?

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:37.200
Because I love Aikatsu too!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.750
Yes!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.500
Yume-chan.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:51.880
Thank you very much for doing Aikatsu with me.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:56.760
Why are you thanking me? I haven't been able to mentor you well at all.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.890
That isn't true.

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:04.270
The way you work so hard every day makes you shine with power overflowing.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:08.030
Watching you do that gives me energy.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.110
Very, very much.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.160
I finally said it.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:22.160
I've always wanted to tell you that.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.170
Thank you.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.500
You're like my older sister.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.550
Being with you is exciting.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:35.050
I'm glad to hear that. Your sister, huh?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:39.930
Aria-chan, let's make today's show a blast.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.230
Yeah!

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:53.400
Futaba Aria—May the flower of Aikatsu bloom!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.200
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.140
Dresses are a charm for beauty!{aw, you didn't keep good-look charm?}

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.990
Dresses can make everyone shine!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:53.100
I haven't seen Yume have that much fun in a while!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.770
I'm so glad.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.110
We don't have to worry anymore.

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.690
Hime-senpai!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.200
Well done.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:06.070
Hime-chan, you came to watch!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.950
What did you think of our performance?

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:13.040
It was fantastic. You were both radiant.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.790
Yay, we did it!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:17.710
I'm really happy to hear that from you.

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:22.170
You showed me how much you loved Aikatsu.

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:30.640
<i>Could it be that Hime-senpai had me do this show in order to teach me that?</i>

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:35.940
Oh right, hang on a sec.

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:46.570
Here, for you.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:50.530
Thanks for singing with me.

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:54.580
So cute! It's very cute.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.460
Thank you!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.920
I'm the one who should be thanking you. {you word}

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:01.460
I had a lot of fun today!

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:06.840
Actually, we both ended up bringing bouquets to our own show...

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:09.970
Don't you think we're kind of strange?

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:17.770
Aria-chan, thank you. I remembered something important.

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:23.940
I really do love Aikatsu!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:57.790
I'm in love!

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:02.830
And taking the stage with you made me fall even deeper in love with Aikatsu!

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:06.540
Our two pairs of wings made for an extravagant performance.

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:10.010
I won't lose to my rival in love for Aikatsu!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.090
Booths and plays!

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:14.760
I'm so excited for the school festival!

